  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The thesis",
      "items": [
        "The infrastructure is the portable asset — the data stays where it lives",
        "Plain markdown is the system of record; SQLite can be thrown away and rebuilt",
        "No personal-login credential paths: API keys via env, CLIs the operator installs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Built vs planned",
      "items": [
        "Built: the spine — jobs, module contract (ADR-0022), finance module, runner core + check-retry, script + claude-cli engines, 850 tests",
        "Planned: cursor engine, Obsidian plugin, web surface"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Execution model",
      "items": [
        "Per-skill engine routing — the model behind a skill is a one-line change",
        "Workers' success claims are ignored: a check command's exit 0 decides, one retry with failure context",
        "Every attempt emits eval events: engine, duration, outcome"
      ]
    }
  ]
